# microservice specific routes

POST /monthly/:zReference                                  uk.gov.hmrc.disareturns.controllers.SubmitReturnsController.submit(zReference:String)

POST /monthly/:zReference/declaration                      uk.gov.hmrc.disareturns.controllers.DeclarationController.declare(zReference:String)

GET /monthly/:zReference/results                           uk.gov.hmrc.disareturns.controllers.ReconciliationResultController.retrieveReconciliationReportPage(zReference:String, page: String ?= "0")

## Reconciliation Report Ready Callback
POST /callback/monthly/:zReference                         uk.gov.hmrc.disareturns.controllers.ReconciliationReportReadyCallbackController.callback(zReference: String)
